    "description": "CleanTech marks new era for Sri Lanka\u2019s Circular Economy with Good Plastic recycling certification",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/CleanTech-marks-new-era-for-Sri-Lanka-s-Circular-Economy-with-Good-Plastic-recycling-certification/34-787378",
