    "chunk_size_bytes": 1338,
    "chunk_text": "Brandix launches A/L scholarships to grow apparel leaders\n\nBrandix Corporate Campus (BCC) has launched a new scholarship framework for Advanced Level (A/L) students, aiming to build the next generation of leaders for Sri Lanka\u2019s apparel industry.\n\nThe initiative offers three merit-based scholarships. The top award provides full tuition and a guaranteed Graduate Trainee position at Brandix for students with outstanding A/L results and provincial/national achievements in sports or co-curriculars. Two additional half-scholarships are also available.\n\nA structured achievement-based discount framework offers benefits up to LKR 300,000, recognizing academic performance and extracurricular involvement. Family discounts for students connected to the industry are included.\n\nThe scheme applies to BCC\u2019s flagship Advanced Diploma and Diploma programs. This talent development drive responds to the industry\u2019s growing need for technically competent and professionally rounded future-ready professionals.\n\nDFCC Aloka empowers entrepreneurs as key sponsor of women\u2019s awards\n\nIcon V Talpe markets elite beachfront residences to global buyers\n\nLeave a Reply Cancel replyYour email address will not be published. Required fields are marked *Comment * Name *\n\nSave my name, email, and website in this browser for the next time I comment."
