    "description": "ITC Ratnadipa welcomes Bukhara Chef JP Singh in father\u2013son collaboration at Peshawri",
    "url_metadata": "http://island.lk/itc-ratnadipa-welcomes-bukhara-chef-jp-singh-in-father-son-collaboration-at-peshawri/",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "islandlk",
