    "date_str": "2026-01-27",
    "description": "\u2665 \u201cSingara Velanae Deva\u201d- S.Janaki\u2019s Superb Solo in Abheri  Raga with  Karukkuruchi Arunasalam\u2019s Nadaswaram Accompaniment \u266b",
    "url_metadata": "https://dbsjeyaraj.com/dbsj/?p=47328",
